{
 "_about": "The viewer's Build patch and Test in OpenMW links' decisions, one way for the Python side and the viewer's: run by tests/test_buildjob_cases.py (wraithguard.patch.buildjob and testrun) and viewer-shell/editcore/tests/cases.rs (editcore::buildjob and testrun). Each case is a `kind` - target, check and preview (where a patch goes), mode (whether editBuild starts), next and status (a build's job and editBuildStatus), setups and setup (editTestSetups, a launch setup checked), launch (OpenMW's command line), test (what editTestRun starts with), settings (the file they are kept in) - with its `args`, `{tmp}` a folder of its own holding the case's `dirs` and `files`. `expect` is the answer, or {error}. Generated from the Python side when a case is added, and read by hand.",
